# Cursor AI rules — Your Date Genie

You are working on Your Date Genie, an AI-powered date-planning iOS app + companion marketing website. The founder (Anjela Arora) is targeting iOS App Store submission on **2026-05-18** and public launch on **2026-05-27**. Treat every change with that timeline in mind: ship fast, but don't break Apple compliance.

---

## Project context

**The product:** AI date-planning app. Users describe their relationship and preferences; the app generates personalized date itineraries, gift suggestions, love notes, and playlists. Premium subscribers get unlimited generations and the upcoming Couple Plan (both partners share account).

**Stack:**
- **iOS:** SwiftUI app at `ios/`. Uses Supabase Swift SDK, StoreKit 2, native AVKit/PhotoKit (add-only).
- **Web (marketing site):** Vite + React + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui. Hosts landing, pricing, waitlist, /terms, /privacy.
- **Backend:** Supabase project `jhpwacmsocjmzhimtbxj`. Postgres + RLS + Edge Functions (Deno) + Auth + Storage. Service-role key NEVER appears in client code.
- **Marketing data:** Firebase project `xcode-490005`, Firestore `waitlist` collection. Pre-launch only; archived after launch.
- **Email:** Resend (transactional)
- **Analytics:** Plausible (web). RevenueCat planned post-launch (iOS subscription analytics).

**Legal entity:** Your Date Genie **LLC** (not "Inc." — locked decision)
**Support contact:** `hello@yourdategenie.com`
**Pricing (locked 2026-04-29):**
- Premium Monthly: $14.99
- Premium Annual: $119.99
- Free trial: 7 days
- Free tier: 3 AI date plans/month + 5 saved plans
- Couple Plan (post-v1): $19.99/month

